lf-contract 0.1
id lf-in-range/0
word lf-in-range
ir tests/program/ir/examples.ir
stack ( value lower upper -- flag true | false )
inputs value lower upper
statement For integers v, l, u in the cell range: if l > u the word returns false; otherwise it returns a flag that is true (-1) exactly when l ≤ v ≤ u and false (0) otherwise, then true. Cells below are kept.
case lower > upper
  out false
case lower <= upper
  out f true
  ensure f = flag(lower <= value && value <= upper)
expect discharged
